<?xml version="1.0" encoding="us-ascii"?>
<XML ID="EQInterfaceDefinitionLanguage">
  <Schema xmlns="EverQuestData" xmlns:dt="EverQuestDataTypes" />
<!--
  NMS Loot Manager window (InstancedLoot front end).
  Resizable version: drag the window edges. Lists stretch, buttons and hints stay pinned to the edges.
  If the layout looks wrong on your client, use NMS_LootWnd_fixed.xml instead (rename it to NMS_LootWnd.xml).
  Every item name here starts with "NMSLoot" so it cannot collide with another window's pieces.
  Buttons reuse the button art declared in NMS_WaypointsWnd.xml (A_EQLS_LargeBtn*), so this file
  must be installed next to NMS_WaypointsWnd.xml in every skin folder you ship, e.g. uifiles\default.
  Checkboxes and frames use the stock templates BDT_Checkbox, WDT_Inner and WDT_Filigree
  (the same ones the waypoint window uses).
-->

